   </title>
   <reference code="270215" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conceptual Model for a National Monitoring and Evaluation (M&amp;E) Framework - Development of a proposed M&amp;E model for the regular monitoring of service delivery performance across Ministries, Departments and Agencies (MDAs) and counties. Includes the identification of a core set of service delivery indicators in collaboration with sectors.</narrative>
